# CareLinkMN Color System Rules

## 🚨 CRITICAL RULE: No Hardcoded Colors Allowed

For the CareLinkMN healthcare platform, **ALL colors must use the global color system** defined in `apps/web/src/app/globals.css`.

## ❌ FORBIDDEN

### Hardcoded Color Values

- **Hex colors**: `#ffffff`, `#000000`, `#3b82f6`, `#10b981`, etc.
- **RGB/RGBA**: `rgb(255, 255, 255)`, `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)`, etc.
- **HSL**: `hsl(0, 0%, 100%)`, `hsl(217, 91%, 60%)`, etc.

### Hardcoded Tailwind Color Names

- **Color names with numbers**: `bg-blue-500`, `text-red-600`, `border-green-200`, etc.
- **Gradient colors**: `bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-600`
- **Any Tailwind color**: `white`, `black`, `red-500`, `blue-100`, etc.

## ✅ REQUIRED

### CSS Custom Properties

```css
/* Use global color variables */
hsl(var(--primary))
hsl(var(--background))
hsl(var(--foreground))
```

### Semantic Color Names

```css
/* Use semantic color classes */
text-foreground
bg-background
border-border
text-muted-foreground
```

### Healthcare Variants

```tsx
// Use component variants
<Button variant="healthcare" />
<Card variant="healthcareSuccess" />
<Badge variant="healthcareWarning" />
```

### Opacity Modifiers

```css
/* Use opacity with global colors */
bg-primary/10
text-success/80
border-warning/20
```

## 🎨 Global Color Palette

### Primary Colors

- **Primary**: `--primary` (Healthcare blue)
- **Secondary**: `--secondary` (Healthcare green)
- **Accent**: `--accent` (Healthcare orange)

### Status Colors

- **Success**: `--success` (Healthcare green)
- **Warning**: `--warning` (Healthcare yellow)
- **Error**: `--destructive` (Healthcare red)
- **Info**: `--info` (Healthcare blue)

### Semantic Colors

- **Foreground**: `--foreground` (Text color)
- **Background**: `--background` (Page background)
- **Muted**: `--muted-foreground` (Secondary text)
- **Border**: `--border` (Border color)
- **Input**: `--input` (Input border)
- **Ring**: `--ring` (Focus ring)

## 🔍 Verification Commands

Run these commands to ensure no hardcoded colors exist:

```bash
# Check for hex colors
grep -r "#[0-9a-fA-F]\{3,6\}" apps/web/src

# Check for RGB/RGBA/HSL
grep -r "rgb(\|rgba(\|hsl([^v]" apps/web/src

# Check for hardcoded Tailwind colors
grep -r "\(white\|black\|red\|blue\|green\|yellow\|orange\|purple\|pink\|indigo\|gray\|slate\|zinc\|neutral\|stone\|amber\|emerald\|teal\|cyan\|sky\|violet\|fuchsia\|rose\)-[0-9]" apps/web/src
```

All commands should return **empty results**.

